WEBVTT

00:02:58.796 --> 00:03:03.636
the distance gets further and further
if you are not meeting them.

00:03:03.676 --> 00:03:06.996
But it also shows you the ones

00:03:06.996 --> 00:03:11.636
that don't disappear
because of the time or the distance.

00:03:11.676 --> 00:03:14.756
They will be there for you
if you need them.

00:03:14.796 --> 00:03:16.276
So the special friends.

00:03:16.316 --> 00:03:19.956
And this difficult time
shows you who cares

00:03:19.996 --> 00:03:23.476
and who is a good person
or a good friend."

00:03:24.516 --> 00:03:25.836
I think she's right.

00:03:25.876 --> 00:03:27.756
I don't think there's a magical formula

00:03:27.756 --> 00:03:29.676
or a mythical number of hours to chase.

00:03:29.716 --> 00:03:31.556
This just takes time and effort.